来源与署名 / Provenance

行为参考 / Gameplay reference:

  Forgotten Relics: RE (1.12.2)
    Author : Nyonio (NNYYOONNIIOO) and contributors
    License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
    Project: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forgotten-relics-re
    Source : https://github.com/NNYYOONNIIOO/Forgotten-Relics-RE

本项目的行为参考 Forgotten Relics: RE，已取得该项目作者同意。
Gameplay behavior is based on Forgotten Relics: RE with the author's permission.

资产参考 / Asset reference:

  Forgotten Relics (原版 / original, 1.7.10)
    Author : Integral (a.k.a. Extegral / VictorShadow)
    License: WTFPL
    Source : https://github.com/jss2a98aj/Forgotten-Relics

本项目的美术资产参考原版 Forgotten Relics，原版资产与文本归原作者所有。
Art assets are based on the original Forgotten Relics; original assets and text
remain credited to their creators.

本项目针对 Minecraft 1.21.1 / NeoForge 的 API 独立实现，并适配 Thaumaturge
的研究与充能体系，加入研究笔记解锁、条件研究及召唤物行为与渲染调整。
This project implements modern Minecraft 1.21.1 / NeoForge APIs, integrates
Thaumaturge research and charging, and adds research-note gates, conditional
research and revised summon behavior and rendering.

本模组为社区非官方项目。作者同意不表示本项目属于原作者的官方发布。
This is an unofficial community project; permission does not imply an official
release by the original creators.

MIT 协议覆盖本项目的代码与文档；参考项目及原版资产保留各自许可与署名。
Minecraft 本体以及 Thaumaturge、Curios、Botania 等前置模组各有自己的协议。
The MIT license covers this project's code and documentation. Reference projects
and original assets retain their respective licenses and credits. Minecraft,
Thaumaturge, Curios, Botania and other dependencies have their own licenses.
